ps://api.github.com/users/marcosc90/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/marcosc90/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-25T19:58:09Z","updated_at":"2025-04-25T19:58:41Z","body":"For web builds, AFAIK `iconv` can be statically linked (though I don’t think it’ll be worth it), a polyfill can be used to implement the new methods, or support can be dropped entirely (at least temporarily) for:\n\n```\nString.to_multibyte_char_buffer(encoding)\nPackedByteArray.get_string_from_multibyte_char(encoding)\n```\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2831322439/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2831339934","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105766#issuecomment-2831339934","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105766","id":2831339934,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6owtGe","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-25T20:08:41Z","updated_at":"2025-04-25T20:08:41Z","body":"> For web builds, AFAIK `iconv` can be statically linked\n\nI think Emscripten has builtin support for `iconv`, we just need to not try to load it dynamically.\n\nFYI, I've reproduced the issue and I'm testing a fix. I'll post a PR soon!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2831339934/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2831354141","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105766#issuecomment-2831354141","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105766","id":2831354141,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6owwkd","user":{"login":"dsnopek","id":191561,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MTU2MQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/191561?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek","html_url":"https://github.com/dsnopek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dsnopek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"http